    <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-out-links"><div class="sumcard done"><div class="sumcard-icon">🌐</div><div class="sumcard-body"><div class="sumcard-head"><span class="pill done">Done</span><strong>Outbound links — informational only</strong></div><div class="sumcard-text">49 external domains are linked sitewide (NHS, BDA, ADA, NCBI, social profiles, booking platform, etc.). Reviewed for safety — all <code>target="_blank"</code> links carry <code>rel="noopener noreferrer"</code> sitewide via a footer script. No action needed.</div></div></div><div class="sumcard partial"><div class="sumcard-icon">🌐</div><div class="sumcard-body"><div class="sumcard-head"><span class="pill partial">New findings — 25 Jul 2026 live verification</span><strong>11 genuine broken out-links found (excl. Services collection / mega-menu, both out of scope)</strong></div><div class="sumcard-text">Checked live status of every internal out-link target across all 549 pages plus all 196 unique external out-link domains. The large majority of broken internal targets are <code>/services/*</code> or <code>/services-groups/*</code> paths — deprecated Services collection or the mega-menu-feeding Services Groups collection, both out of scope per standing project rules, not counted. <strong>Genuinely broken links found (real defects, not yet fixed):</strong> <code>/team/pedro-gutierres</code> (should be <code>/team/dr-pedro-gutierres</code>), <code>www.maidasmiles.co.uk/team-members/dr-claudia-lorenzo</code> and <code>/team-members/dr-shankar-bala</code> (old <code>www</code> + old <code>/team-members/</code> path; correct is <code>/team/dr-claudia-lorenzo</code> and <code>/team/dr-shankar-bala</code>), <code>www.maidasmiles.co.uk/post/what-you-should-know-about-invisalign</code> (old <code>/post/</code> path; correct is <code>/blog/what-you-should-know-about-invisalign</code>), <code>/dentalimplant/all-on-4/consultation</code>, <code>/dentalimplant/dental-implant-procedure</code>, <code>/dentalimplant/implant-denture-consultation</code>, and a stray old-structure family <code>/dentistry</code>, <code>/dentistry/gum-disease</code>, <code>/dentistry/getting-braces-as-an-adult</code>, <code>/treatments/*</code> (4 URLs). <strong>External partner site fully dead:</strong> <code>clearbracesmaidavale.co.uk</code> and its <code>/book-now</code> page both 404 — every page linking there is sending users to a dead external site. Not fixed (report-only pass); recommend repointing hrefs in place once reviewed. Full list: <code>scratchpad/live-audit-2026-07-25.md</code>.</div></div></div><div class="sumcard done"><div class="sumcard-icon">🌐</div><div class="sumcard-body"><div class="sumcard-head"><span class="pill done">Fixed — 25 Jul 2026</span><strong>9 of 11 broken out-links repointed and published</strong></div><div class="sumcard-text">Fixed and published: <code>/team/pedro-gutierres</code> → <code>/team/dr-pedro-gutierres</code> (2 locations: /dentures static page, /blog/dentist-pedro-gutierres), old <code>/team-members/</code> paths for Dr Claudia Lorenzo and Dr Shankar Bala → correct <code>/team/</code> paths (4 locations across 3 blog posts, plus a third instance of the Pedro old-path pattern found mid-fix on the root-canal post), old <code>/post/what-you-should-know-about-invisalign</code> → <code>/blog/...</code>, <code>/dentalimplant/all-on-4/consultation</code> → <code>/dentalimplant/consultation</code>, <code>/dentalimplant/dental-implant-procedure</code> → <code>/dentalimplant/procedure</code>, <code>/dentistry/gum-disease</code> → <code>/gum-disease</code>, and <code>/treatments/cosmeticdentistry</code> → <code>/cosmetic-dentistry</code> (4 locations: all London-borough × cosmetic-dentist pages). <strong>Still open, not fixed (needs a source decision, not a mechanical fix):</strong> <code>/dentalimplant/implant-denture-consultation</code>, <code>/dentistry/getting-braces-as-an-adult</code>, bare <code>/dentistry</code>, and the remaining 3 <code>/treatments/*</code> URLs have no confirmed correct target. The dead external partner site <code>clearbracesmaidavale.co.uk</code> (5 pages, both root and /book-now) is pending a client decision on what to do with the mention — not yet actioned.</div></div></div>
    
        
        
