ection (not text-scraping):</strong> both <a href="https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/dentalimplant/costs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/dentalimplant/costs</a> and <a href="https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/dentalimplant/all-on-4-costs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/dentalimplant/all-on-4-costs</a>, previously flagged as "possibly scrambled" by the automated text crawl, are actually 100% correct — Single Implant £2,500, Implant Dentures £6,500, Full Mouth Implants £16,000&ndash;£25,000, Implant Bridges £2,000, Sinus Lift £1,950, Bone Graft £950, Implant Consultation £115 all verified against the true DOM structure (a price-then-caption card layout, which is why the flattened text looked shifted by one item). No fix needed &mdash; false alarm from the earlier crawl methodology, now cleared.
