<h2>Pages the Original Audit Missed</h2>
<ul><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/general-dentists/specialist-services — a large hardcoded master fee table covering Consultations, Prosthodontics, Extractions, Root Canal, Hygiene, Cosmetic (veneers/bonding/whitening), Dental Implants. Not referenced in the prior report; contains 7 STILL_WRONG discrepancies (Invisalign Consultation, Periodontal Consultation, Root Canal &#x27;from&#x27; price, Hygiene Visit, Hygiene with Dentist, Composite bonding, Sinus Lift).</li><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/general-dentists/root-canal — has a correct Incisor/Premolar/Molar table but a self-contradictory hero line (&#x27;Root canals from £950&#x27;) and a mispriced &#x27;Dental crown from £900&#x27;.</li><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io (homepage) — has a live price table for implants (Sinus Lift shown at £950 vs official £1,950) and a self-contradicting &#x27;Implant-retained dentures From £4,900&#x27; vs &#x27;From £6,500&#x27; shown higher on the same page.</li><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/orthodontists/ceramic-braces, /orthodontists/metal-braces, /orthodontists/self-ligating-braces, /orthodontists/retainers, /orthodontists/retainers-vivera — all carry a recurring &#x27;related services&#x27; sidebar widget quoting per-arch prices (Invisalign £2,060/arch, Metal £1,500/arch, Ceramic £1,250/arch, Self-ligating £1,625/arch) that is inconsistent with the Ceramic Braces figure used in the page body and on the main /orthodontists table.</li><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/general-dentists/childrens-dentistry — hero banner &#x27;Check-up prices from £55&#x27; contradicts the page&#x27;s own &#x27;Child Dental Examination £95&#x27; figure further down.</li><li>https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/periodontists — the only page on the live site with a genuine periodontal price table; not clearly identified as authoritative in the prior report, and its &#x27;Periodontal Treatment £1,250&#x27; / &#x27;Advanced Hygiene £160&#x27; / &#x27;Laser Gum Surgery POA&#x27; line items do not correspond by name to any of the 11 official periodontal treatment items.</li><li>The Fee Service categories CMS collection (id 689cea4668eaa0b364885ac4) contains exactly 13 category items and structurally has NO &#x27;Periodontal Treatment&#x27; category — confirmed via direct CMS query, not inferred from a missing URL. There is and can be no /price-serice-category/periodontal-treatment page until this category is created.</li><li>The Services collection (id 689ce2c0899759a3492ed15e, deprecated per project rules, read-only) contains exactly one item named &#x27;Periodontal treatment&#x27; (id 68b1ca74aa89bcd9691fae9a), fee £1,450, mapped to the &#x27;Other Services&#x27; fee-category rather than any periodontal-specific category — this is why a periodontal price surfaces unexpectedly on https://maidasmiles.webflow.io/price-serice-category/other-services-mhble instead of a periodontal-specific page.</li><li><strong>UPDATE 20 July 2026 (3rd pass) — this scope gap is now closed.</strong> All 395 EN blog posts (241 live) and all 10 London borough/location pages were individually reconciled against the official 2026 price sheet. 5 genuine blog price errors and 8 borough pages sharing 2 recurring errors (13 pages/edits total) were found, fixed, published, and verified live — see the "Blog &amp; Borough Page Sweep" section above for the full list. 4 additional ambiguous cases were flagged for a client decision rather than auto-edited. Nothing remains unchecked from the original 242-page sitemap scan.</li></ul>

